<title>USA: R.O.C. Taiwan Fund says to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>R.O.C. Taiwan Fund says to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>R.O.C. Taiwan Fund said Wednesday that its board of trustees authorized the repurchase of up to an additional $10 million worth of its shares.</p>
<p>The move is in addition to last month's decision to buy back $15 million in shares, bringing the total repurchase program to $25 million, the fund said.</p>
<p>So far, the fund said, it has repurchased 396,200 shares for about $4.8 million.</p>
<p>The fund has 33.8 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
